{
  "uid": "mvp-communication-pipeline",
  "title": "Communication Pipeline",
  "tags": [
    "mvp",
    "communications"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Domanda:** le bozze vengono generate correttamente, e dove si ferma chi non arriva in fondo?\n\nStessa struttura della dashboard documenti, così le due pipeline si leggono con la stessa abitudine. Alert correlati: `CommunicationStuckInProcessing`, `CommunicationPipelineTaskFailed`, `CommunicationCoverStorageFailing` — Runbook: docs/runbooks/communication-pipeline.md"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dove si fermano",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Imbuto della pipeline comunicazioni",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 16,
        "h": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_generation)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "1 · Richieste",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_generation{generation_status=\"completed\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "2 · Testo generato",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communication_covers{cover_status=\"ready\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "3 · Copertina pronta",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications{status=\"approved\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "4 · Approvate",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Il passo 3 può restare indietro senza che sia un guasto: una copertina degradata non invalida la bozza, che resta leggibile e approvabile. Il salto fra 2 e 4 è invece la quota di bozze su cui nessuno ha ancora deciso."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Oltre timeout",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_stuck_processing)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "bloccate",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Generazioni oltre MVP_COMMUNICATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS. Su questo scatta CommunicationStuckInProcessing."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Generazioni fallite",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#EAB839",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_generation{generation_status=\"failed\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "fallite",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "La generazione del testo non è riuscita: la comunicazione resta senza bozza."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Stato corrente",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Generate",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_generation{generation_status=\"completed\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "generate",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "In generazione",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_generation{generation_status=\"processing\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "in corso",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Copertine degradate",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communication_covers{cover_status=\"failed\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "degradate",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Esito previsto, non un guasto: CommunicationCoverGenerationDegraded scatta solo oltre tre in trenta minuti."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Media stelle",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "mvp_communication_rating_average",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "media",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Qualità percepita delle bozze, su 5. Zero quando nessuna bozza è stata ancora valutata."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bozze valutate",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mvp_communications_rated)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "valutate",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Numero di bozze su cui è stata espressa una valutazione: dà la base su cui è calcolata la media stelle accanto."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Flusso e cause",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput step pipeline (rate 5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (task_type) (rate(mvp_sqs_messages_received_total{task_type=~\"communication.*\"}[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{task_type}} ricevuti"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (task_type) (rate(mvp_sqs_messages_failed_total{task_type=~\"communication.*\"}[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{task_type}} falliti"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Solo i task della pipeline comunicazioni, in simmetria con il filtro della dashboard documenti."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Fallimenti Step Functions per motivo",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (mvp_stepfunctions_executions_failed_total{state_machine=~\".*communication-pipeline\"})",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "fallimenti",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "reason": "Motivo",
              "Value": "Fallimenti"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "`start_failure` è un avvio rifiutato, `task_failure` un task interrotto. Prima del fix sulle label, i secondi non comparivano in questa dashboard."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Copertine: esito (rate 5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(mvp_communication_covers_generated_total[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "generate {{source}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(mvp_communication_covers_failed_total[5m]))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "degradate {{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "`source` distingue le copertine prodotte dal modello da quelle caricate a mano."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Decisione sulla bozza",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (mvp_communications)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "comunicazioni",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "status": "Decisione",
              "Value": "Comunicazioni"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Esito del prodotto, distinto dallo stato tecnico della generazione: una bozza generata correttamente può comunque essere scartata."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Log",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Errori pipeline (worker comunicazioni + app)",
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{project=\"mvp\", service=~\"queue-communications|app\"} |~ \"(?i)level_name.{0,6}(error|critical|emergency)\"",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      }
    }
  ]
}
